  IconPath: icons/skills/wounds/injury-stapled-flesh-tan.webp
  Description: "Usage imbued in the skin A scar on your body commemorates a time
    someone tried to end your story and failed\u2014a testament to your resilience
    and fortitude. Immanence Divine energy spreads outward from your scar, reinforcing
    your flesh. You gain the benefits of the Diehard feat and a +1 status bonus to
    Fortitude saving throws. Transcendence\u2014 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.No
